{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55624","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十二 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"且停多事莫矜夸，寂寞门中有道华。\n隈岭静同猿窟宅，栽松闲共鹤生涯。\n荣来只爱添余录禄，春过谁能悟落花。\n唯有卧云尘外客，无思无虑老烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}